OL,3,GNEWSAGloucestershire M5 junction to
OL,4,Aclose for two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA junction on the M5 in Gloucestershire
OL,7,Fwill be shut for two years so work can
OL,8,Fbe carried out to upgrade it.
OL,10,FJunction 10 is getting a multi-million
OL,11,Fpound upgrade which, when completed,
OL,12,Fwill mean drivers will be able to leave
OL,13,Fand join it whether they are travelling
OL,14,Fnorth or southbound on the motorway -
OL,15,Foptions which are currently not
OL,16,Favailable.
OL,18,FThe scheme, which also includes
OL,19,Fupgrading surrounding roads, is
OL,20,Fexpected to cost #372m in total.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
