OL,3,GNEWSAGloucestershire M5 junction to
OL,4,Aclose for two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty councillor Julian Tooke said
OL,7,Fslip road closures will be needed so
OL,8,F"the most complex parts of the work"
OL,9,Fcan be carried out safely and quickly.
